        "created_at": "2015-10-20T19:40:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MRogers\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e0b2c6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MRogers:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hiya, Moro Rogers here. That green spirit was from my portfolio, it's not actually in the game. Sorry!=p</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Welcome to the forums! I look forward to seeing more of your art in the final version of the game.</p>",
